      {
        "id": 243795,
        "name": "Matchstickman",
        "username": "Matchstickman",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
        "created_at": "2022-03-23T18:42:58.650Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I don’t think that level of threshold would allow you to resolve a power that has already been resolved this turn.<br>\nBut my gut says that if you also meet the other thresholds which would allow you to reclaim and then play and pay for the same power you just resolved, I think you could then repeat the power if you targeted the same Spirit with a second use of Slip the Flow of Time, as the card that was in play is not the same as the one that is in play now.</p>\n<p>But I have no official reasoning for believing this.</p>",
